{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）10時半，一名老婦到西貢破邊洲行山，期間疑感到不適，頭暈乏力，於是報案求助。救援人員接報後，政府飛行服務隊派出直升機，將老婦救起送院檢查。</p><p>今早天文台表示，天氣炎熱可能影響健康，市民應保持警惕，多補充水分。在戶外活動的人士，應留意身體健康狀況。帶備食水及防曬用品，以及減少長時間在陽光下曝曬。</p><figure><img alt=\"西貢破邊洲有一名女子行山時頭暈乏力。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260927/1180874803188338688562193.jpeg/5WHSe5X1P7WExIqu7hKPXovkrcDk77LdCx9logsfZaI\"/><figcaption>西貢破邊洲有一名女子行山時頭暈乏力。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有老婦在破邊洲行山時感到頭暈乏力。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188829634695794688807512.jpeg/yekWyclntZV2FvnLYPqIGKcIgMx6jveGbmif8W5on_E\"/><figcaption>有老婦在破邊洲行山時感到頭暈乏力。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:58:45.430373+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:39:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:18:43.198810+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:57:38.511241+00:00","content_hash":"2a795d3d7dd14eb28aafc7cb1985be031c0f306ce744662bc12c21a913f1e35c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}